[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

[[Treant]]s are rare tree-like [[Creatures]] with large root-like limbs, wooden bodies, and crooked branches. They are always on the move, dashing to and fro through the trees. Treants cannot be attacked or otherwise interacted with.

It is unknown whether witnessing a Treant triggers an [[Experience Events|Experience Event]]. Presently, their only apparent purpose is for visual flavor, much like the [[Dryad]]. 

